CSS Prep App allows users to delete their account and associated data directly from within the app.

 In-App Account Deletion

To delete your account:

1. Open CSS Prep App.
2. Go to Profile / Account section.
3. Tap Delete Account.
4. Confirm deletion.

After confirmation, your account and associated app data will be deleted.

 Request Account Deletion by Email

If you no longer have access to the app, you may request account deletion by email.

Please send your request to:

hrqaiser@gmail.com

Use the subject line:

Delete My CSS Prep App Account

Please include the email address used to create your CSS Prep App account.

 Data Deleted

When your account is deleted, the following data associated with your account may be deleted:

- Firebase Authentication account
- Name and email address
- Learning progress
- Test attempts and scores
- Saved preferences
- Evaluation history
- Uploaded images or PDF files, where applicable

 Data Retention

Some limited technical or security logs may be retained temporarily if required for security, fraud prevention, legal compliance, or system integrity.

 Processing Time

Email-based deletion requests are normally processed within a reasonable period after verification.

